.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cursor-session-export 1 "" "cursor-session 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cursor\-session\-export \- Export sessions to files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcursor\-session export\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-storage\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-workspace\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export sessions to files
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: md]
Output file format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
md
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.IP \(bu 2
yaml
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: exports]
Directory to write into (created if missing)
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-id\fR \fI<SESSION_ID>\fR
Export only this session (ID or unique prefix)
.TP
\fB\-\-workspace\fR \fI<WORKSPACE>\fR
Export the Agent CLI sessions of a workspace: its path or a directory above it, directory names in its path, or the MD5 hash of its path
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Only read this store; the other one is never opened
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
agent: Cursor Agent CLI chats (~/.cursor/chats and agent transcripts)
.IP \(bu 2
ide: Cursor IDE composer chats (state.vscdb)
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<N>\fR
Export only the N most recently updated of the selected sessions
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Export only the sessions updated within this long: a number and s, m, h, d or w (30d, 12h)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-storage\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read only this location: a home, .cursor, chats, workspace, session or projects directory, a store.db or state.vscdb file, or the directory that holds state.vscdb
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the storage paths in use and the rows and files that were skipped to stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
When to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS 4
.nf
cursor\-session export
cursor\-session export \-\-format json \-\-session\-id f4eea6d2 \-\-out sessions
cursor\-session export \-\-workspace ~/src/billing\-api \-\-limit 5
cursor\-session export \-\-since 2w \-\-format json
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.RS 4
.nf
0  Success, also when output is cut short by a closed pipe (e.g. `| head`)
1  Error: session not found, no sessions match (search), unreadable storage, failed healthcheck
2  Usage error: unknown command or flag, invalid value
.fi
.RE
